'''Zhol''' ([[Qymish language|Qymish]]: Ⰸⱁⰾ), officially the '''City of Zhol''' ([[Qymish language|Qymish]]: Ⰿⰹⰵⱄⱅ ⰹⱋ Ⰸⱁⰾ, ''Miest ish Zhol''), is the capital and largest city of [[Qym]], with an estimated city population of #,###,### in an area of ### km², and a metropolitan population of 21,078,935 as of {{abbr|2440|2027 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}. Located at the confluence of the rivers [[Foldava]] and [[Mizhpy]], in the [[Barony of Zhol|barony]] and [[Duchy of Zhol|duchy of the same name]], Zhol is Qym's economic center and the seat of the [[Government of Qym|Qymish government]] and the [[King of Qym]]. 

