===Climate===
Zhol has a [[wikipedia:Humid continental climate|humid continental climate]] with temperate summers, or ''Dfb'' in the [[wikipedia:Köppen climate classification|Köppen classification]]. The average annual temperature was 6.8°C between {{abbr|2380|1977 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} and {{abbr|2440|2027 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}. The warmest month is TBD and the coldest is TBD. On average, there are 7 days above 30°C and 14 days below −20°C per year. Between {{abbr|2380|1977 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} and {{abbr|2440|2027 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}, Zhol received approximately 900 mm of precipitation annually, 691 mm as rain and 209 cm as snow. In that period, the median date for the first snowfall was between MONTH DAY and DAY, and the median period for snowmelt was from MONTH DAY to DAY, for a total of about NUM snowy months every year. 

