===Sports===
Zhol's most popular sport is [[wikipedia:ice hockey|ice hockey]], and it has six franchises in the [[Qymish Hockey League]]: the [[Zhol Squirrels]], the [[Zhol Raccoons]], the [[Zhol Hawks]], the [[Zhol Rabbits]], the [[Zhol Laborers]], and the [[Zhol Chestnuts]]. 

